   "text": "Infraestructura transversal:  Docker Compose (dev)  ·  GitHub Actions (lint, tests, build, deploy)  ·  contenedores en Cloud Run / ECS / VPS  ·  observabilidad (logs, Sentry)  ·  OpenAPI como contrato",
